OL,3,GNEWSAMan, 83, still coaches club he
OL,4,Afounded in 1966
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I just enjoyed basketball so much that
OL,7,FI wanted other people to enjoy it as
OL,8,Fmuch as I did."
OL,10,FIlkeston Outlaws Basketball Club was
OL,11,Fset up by Paul Booth in 1966, when he
OL,12,Fwas a resistant materials teacher at
OL,13,FIlkeston's St John Houghton School,
OL,14,Ffresh from graduating at Loughborough
OL,15,FUniversity.
OL,17,FDecades on and Booth, now 83, still
OL,18,Floves the game and is continuing to
OL,19,Fcoach the volunteer-run club
OL,20,Fcelebrating 60 years.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
