OL,3,GNEWSAMan, 83, still coaches club he
OL,4,Afounded in 1966
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe club, now based at Kirk Hallam
OL,7,FCommunity Academy, started with just a
OL,8,Fdozen players but has grown to have
OL,9,Fhundreds of players across 10 teams,
OL,10,Ffrom children as young as seven up to
OL,11,Fseniors - including some of the
OL,12,Foriginal pupils Booth trained who are
OL,13,Fnow coaches themselves.
